---
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Concept — Text Heavy</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://api.fontshare.com" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=general-sans@400,500,600&display=swap"
    />
    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: #fdfdfc;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        font-family: "General Sans", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
      }

      .frame-label {
        position: fixed;
        top: 16px;
        left: 24px;
        color: #b5b3ae;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        z-index: 5;
      }

      .col {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 1.5rem;
      }

      header {
        padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
      }

      header .name {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      header nav {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #6b6b6b;
      }

      header nav a {
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      header nav a:hover {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }

      .intro p {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: #2b2b2b;
        margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
      }

      .intro p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .intro a {
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-color: #c9c7c0;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
      }

      .intro a:hover {
        text-decoration-color: #1a1a1a;
      }

      section {
        padding: 3.5rem 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #e6e4de;
      }

      .section-heading {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        color: #8a8a8a;
        margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
      }

      .work-row {
        display: block;
        padding: 1.1rem 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #eeece7;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .work-row:first-of-type {
        border-top: none;
      }

      .work-row .row-top {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }

      .work-row .title {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }

      .work-row .desc {
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: #8a8a8a;
        margin-top: 0.3rem;
      }

      .work-row .meta {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 0.85rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .work-row .tag {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #b0b0b0;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .work-row .year {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #b0b0b0;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .work-row .arrow {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #c9c7c0;
        transition: color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
        display: inline-block;
      }

      .work-row:hover .title {
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-color: #c9c7c0;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
      }

      .work-row:hover .arrow {
        color: #1a1a1a;
        transform: translate(2px, -2px);
      }

      footer {
        padding: 3.5rem 0 6rem;
        border-top: 1px solid #e6e4de;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #8a8a8a;
      }

      footer a {
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-color: #c9c7c0;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
      }

      footer a:hover {
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="frame-label">Concept — Text Heavy</div>

    <div class="col">
      <header>
        <div class="name">Hum Rashid</div>
        <nav>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <div class="intro">
        <p>
          I'm a designer and founder based in New York City. Most recently I led design at <a
            href="#">Nessa Labs</a>, working with early-stage teams on product strategy and
          interface design — most recently as Design Director on the redesign of <a href="#"
            >Sublime Security</a
          >'s threat platform.
        </p>
        <p>
          I care about the parts of a product that don't show up in a screenshot — the
          onboarding flow nobody notices, the empty state that makes someone feel dumb, the
          setting that should've been a default. That's usually where the real work is.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section>
        <p class="section-heading">Selected Work</p>

        <a class="work-row" href="/work/pack">
          <span class="row-top">
            <span class="title">Pack Digital</span>
            <span class="meta">
              <span class="tag">Product</span>
              <span class="year">20XX</span>
              <span class="arrow">→</span>
            </span>
          </span>
          <span class="desc">Headless commerce, productized</span>
        </a>

        <a class="work-row" href="/work/inveterate">
          <span class="row-top">
            <span class="title">Inveterate</span>
            <span class="meta">
              <span class="tag">Product</span>
              <span class="year">20XX</span>
              <span class="arrow">→</span>
            </span>
          </span>
          <span class="desc">Membership over points</span>
        </a>

        <a class="work-row" href="/work/ppvp">
          <span class="row-top">
            <span class="title">PPVP</span>
            <span class="meta">
              <span class="tag">Mobile</span>
              <span class="year">20XX</span>
              <span class="arrow">→</span>
            </span>
          </span>
          <span class="desc">Exclusive deal flow, mobile-first</span>
        </a>

        <a class="work-row" href="/work/sublime-security">
          <span class="row-top">
            <span class="title">Sublime Security</span>
            <span class="meta">
              <span class="tag">Security</span>
              <span class="year">20XX</span>
              <span class="arrow">→</span>
            </span>
          </span>
          <span class="desc">Quarantine digests, phishing simulations</span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <footer>
        Say hello at <a href="#">hello@humrashid.com</a> or find me on <a href="#"
          >LinkedIn</a
        >.
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
